{
  "name": "RobotFrameworkAIO.Exercise_01",
  "title": "Exercise 01: Building Testsuites",
  "summary": "Write a Robot Framework test suite using RobotFramework_TestsuitesManagement and run it with p1.check().",
  "introduction": [
    "In this exercise you will create a Robot Framework test suite that uses the TestsuitesManagement library.",
    "Assign your robot script to the `robot_code` variable and call `p1.check()` to execute and validate it."
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "title": "Exercise 1: Simple test suite with TestsuitesManagement",
      "prompt": [
        "Create a Robot Framework test suite script and assign it to the `robot_code` variable.",
        "The suite must import `RobotFramework_TestsuitesManagement` with alias `tm` and call `tm.testsuite_setup` as `Suite Setup`.",
        "Add a test case that logs the `${CONFIG}[Maximum_version]` and `${CONFIG}[Project]` configuration values.",
        "Call `p1.check()` to execute the robot script and verify that all tests pass."
      ],
      "starter_code": [
        "robot_code = \"\"\"",
        "*** Settings ***",
        "",
        "Library    RobotFramework_TestsuitesManagement    WITH NAME    tm",
        "",
        "Suite Setup    tm.testsuite_setup",
        "",
        "*** Test Cases ***",
        "Test Case exercise-01",
        "    [documentation]    exercise-01",
        "    Log    <your log statement here>    console=yes",
        "\"\"\"",
        "p1.check()"
      ],
      "hint": [
        "Use the `*** Settings ***` section to import the library and configure `Suite Setup`:",
        "",
        "```",
        "Library    RobotFramework_TestsuitesManagement    WITH NAME    tm",
        "Suite Setup    tm.testsuite_setup",
        "```",
        "",
        "Then in `*** Test Cases ***`, use the `Log` keyword with `console=yes` to print the `${CONFIG}` values.",
        "",
        "Access config values with `${CONFIG}[key_name]` syntax."
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Here is a complete solution:",
        "",
        "```python",
        "robot_code = \"\"\"",
        "*** Settings ***",
        "",
        "Library    RobotFramework_TestsuitesManagement    WITH NAME    tm",
        "",
        "Suite Setup    tm.testsuite_setup",
        "",
        "*** Test Cases ***",
        "Test Case exercise-01",
        "    [documentation]    exercise-01",
        "    Log    Maximum_version : ${CONFIG}[Maximum_version]    console=yes",
        "    Log    Project : ${CONFIG}[Project]    console=yes",
        "\"\"\"",
        "p1.check()",
        "```"
      ],
      "success_message": "Correct. The robot test suite ran successfully.",
      "failure_message": "The robot suite did not pass. Check the robot output above for details.",
      "tags": ["robot", "testsuite", "TestsuitesManagement"]
    }
  ]
}
